 three years of reported Clery Act crime statistics, fire safety information, and information regarding campus and personal safety. Paper copies of the report are available at our Stockton University Police Department located at 101 Vera King Farris Drive in Galloway, NJ - Building 70. To request a copy of the report be sent via postal mail, please send an email to campus.police@stockton.edu or call (609) 652-4390. Apply now! Sign up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 56c3284a Last Name (required) 5d7bc003 Email (required) 7f572a9e Job Alert 47f59f03 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Departments School of Arts and Humanities School of Arts and Humanities Locations Galloway, New Jersey, United States Galloway, New Jersey, United States Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Share this job with a friend! First Name (required) f5697c08 Last Name (required) 0c620cc4 Email (required) 54cd224d Share now Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you - we've sent an email with job to the person you entered. Apply Now! First Name (required) a8e01cb0 Last Name (required) 1bc832bd Email (required) 66390228 Refer someone to this job Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Office of the President Read Stockton Now Media Resources Do Business With Stockton University Alerts Bookstore Library Employment Safety Information Statements & Policies Additional Locations Atlantic City Hammonton Manahawkin Stockton University 101 Vera King Farris Drive Galloway, NJ 08205-9441 (609) 652-1776 Maps, Directions & Parking Accessibility Statement Facebook Twitter YouTube Instagram LinkedIn Flickr Snapchat TikTok Stockton University is an Equal Opportunity Institution © 2022 Stockton University Candidate Details Please choose the location(s)"
