    "https://employment.stockton.edu/jobs/adjunct-faculty-school-of-arts-humanities-comm-studies-pr-advertising-media-production-journalism-community-storytelling-2024-2025-galloway-new-jersey-united-states": {
      "title": "Adjunct Faculty - School of Arts & Humanities, COMM Studies, PR/Advertising, Media Production & Journalism & Community Storytelling",
